{"v":4,"catch":"使用炸彈幹掉多個敵人，獲得高分!\n我們就是這樣做的!","desc":"\"SABOTEN BOMBERS\"是NMK在1992年推出的一款動作遊戲。\n控制一個住在你房子裡的好小仙人掌。\n當你外出時，他會保護你的房子。\n扔炸彈來趕走壞仙人掌和昆蟲。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-04-08","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a1d35eadfc5ef3fa5529d69a27e1f76d23badab6d701e7123a5c3a9230b7c4c7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57c6a97e3cb18a85dde912ffad717ded2cc26f73e78e407ac58cec4e02653bbd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e599c10a7be251c51c5bdadd9f3d25ab570e50993f11966a1828427531938a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d075bdea445597d4bfc66366dd649a85fa840e74d8aa8a1f1e2c4412af634fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e6c104cbf7025e92f7db012192bd193d3f87fc1c78e0fafd07b632c26f2a5f00.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65b5c570bb49b598db1c3c25a3eeb0820246df147b237ef6dfaddbdf25154d98.jpg"],"titleId":"01007c80144d6000","dlc":[]}